From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 14:58:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] ktranslate: document topology discovery in README and
 config sample

Adds a Topology discovery section to the README describing the new
discover_neighbors / neighbor_protocols knobs, the KSnmpTopology event
type, and the JCHF fields that carry each link. Also adds a commented
example device to config/snmp.yaml.sample so users have a concrete
copy/paste starting point.
